  stickyNoteTexts:
  - "Here\u2019s your first artifact, Nova.\nI hope this is a beautiful start to
    your journey here!\n\n-Mrs. Maya :)"
  - P.S Amazing to see this project in the hands of someone so competent! I know
    I can trust you.
